                adventureType_x0040_LastModified="{Date}2020-10-15T13:11:33.083-07:00"
                description="&lt;h3>&lt;b>Learn to surf on the Pacific coast&lt;/b>&lt;/h3>&#xa;&lt;p>The Pacific coast of Costa Rica has warm water all year, long sandy beaches and waves that arrive in orderly lines. Our camp is in a village with one unpaved street, where the forest comes down to the sand. Local instructors teach in groups of three, so the week works equally well for a first-timer and for someone who wants to tidy up their turns.&lt;/p>"
                description_x0040_ContentType="text/html"
                description_x0040_LastModified="{Date}2020-10-15T13:11:33.082-07:00"
                difficulty="Beginner"
                difficulty_x0040_LastModified="{Date}2020-10-15T13:11:33.084-07:00"
                gearList="&lt;div>&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xa;&lt;li>Passport, and some cash in colones or US dollars&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>Swimwear and a rash vest&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>Reef-safe sunscreen and a hat&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>Insect repellent&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>Sandals and light clothes&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xa;&lt;p>Boards, leashes and wax are provided.&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;/div>"
                gearList_x0040_ContentType="text/html"
                gearList_x0040_LastModified="{Date}2020-10-15T13:11:33.085-07:00"
                groupSize="{Long}6"
                groupSize_x0040_LastModified="{Date}2022-05-27T14:52:00.832-07:00"
                itinerary="&lt;p>&lt;b>Day 1&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xa;&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p>Arrival, a welcome drink and a walk on the beach at sunset to look at the waves you will be riding.&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Day 2&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xa;&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p>The first lesson starts on the sand: how to lie, paddle and stand. Then into the white water. A second session follows in the late afternoon.&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Day 3&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xa;&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p>Paddling out past the break and catching unbroken waves. After lunch, a yoga class for stiff shoulders.&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Day 4&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xa;&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p>A morning surf, then a trip by boat up a river through the mangroves, with crocodiles, herons and monkeys along the banks.&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Day 5&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xa;&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p>A dawn session at a second beach reached by a forest track, a late breakfast and departure.&lt;/p>"
